{"id":"n72474-1-7","stage":1,"title":"해외여행 · 海外旅行","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72474-1-7-1","ko":"지수야, 너 다음 주에 해외여행 간다면서? 좋겠다.","zh":"智秀啊，你下周不是要出国旅行吗？听起来真不错啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}},{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"다음","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次。","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}},{"text":"주에","meaning":"一周，一星期","explanation":"주：一周，一星期；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26897","senseId":"1","lemma":"주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주에","audio":"/audio/28e7aef02277c8ef3bcb.mp3"}},{"text":"해외여행","meaning":"海外旅行，境外游","explanation":"해외여행：海外旅行，境外游。","readings":[{"term":"해외여행","audio":"/audio/f6c86ac307762c16c445.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72474","senseId":"1","lemma":"해외여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해외여행","audio":"/audio/f6c86ac307762c16c445.mp3"}},{"text":"간다면서?","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；ㄴ다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"간다면서","audio":"/audi